+### What was implemented
+- Created `src/lib/whatsapp-flows-crypto.ts` — RSA-OAEP (SHA-256) + AES-128-GCM encryption/decryption utilities per Meta's WhatsApp Flows protocol
+  - `decryptRequest()` decrypts incoming encrypted payloads from Meta
+  - `encryptResponse()` re-encrypts response with flipped IV (Meta protocol requirement)
+- Created `src/assistant/data/reservation-flow.json` — Flow JSON v6.3 screen definition with 3 screens:
+  - RESERVATION_DATES: CalendarPicker for check-in/check-out dates with data-exchange validation
+  - RESERVATION_DETAILS: Dropdown for room type, TextInput (number) for guest count, TextArea (600 char max) for special requests
+  - RESERVATION_CONFIRM: Terminal screen showing booking reference and summary
+- Created `src/routes/public/whatsapp-flows.ts` — Data-exchange endpoint handling:
+  - INIT action: returns available room options and date range (today to +90 days)
+  - check_availability / validate_dates: validates dates and checks room availability
+  - submit_reservation: validates all fields, generates booking ref (PEL-YYMMDD-XXXX), persists to DB, sends WhatsApp confirmation
+  - PING health-check: responds {data: {status: 'active'}} for Meta uptime monitoring
+  - GET /whatsapp-flows/health — unencrypted health-check ping endpoint
+  - GET /whatsapp-flows/reservation-flow.json — serves flow JSON definition for Meta registration
+- DB: Auto-creates `wa_flow_reservations` table (lazy creation with _tableEnsured guard)
+- Env vars: `WA_FLOWS_PRIVATE_KEY` or `WA_FLOWS_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` for RSA key; `WA_FLOWS_TOKEN` for flow token validation
