+- Flow JSON CalendarPicker requires WhatsApp Flows API v6.1+, ChipsSelector requires v6.3+
+- Meta requires the data-exchange endpoint to respond within 15 seconds
+- The health-check ping must respond within 5 seconds with exact format {data: {status: 'active'}}
+- GCM auth tag is the last 16 bytes of the encrypted payload (must be extracted before decryption)
+- IV must be bit-flipped (~byte & 0xff) for the response encryption
