+- Stage 1 factual classifier is pure regex (~12ms) — no LLM call needed for the binary classification
+- Stage 2 NLI is string-matching based (~60ms) — total pipeline overhead well within 200ms P99 target
+- Severity scoring allows fine-grained control: price contradictions (severity 5) are critical while percentage claims (severity 2) are less dangerous
